1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:03,999
If someone answers your signal, stay where they can find you.

2
00:00:04,599 --> 00:00:09,144
The Signal. Part four of four. The reply.

3
00:00:09,744 --> 00:00:11,291
Headlights. Three of them.

4
00:00:11,591 --> 00:00:13,587
Stay quiet. Stay put.

5
00:00:14,604 --> 00:00:19,540
Hollis Ford, this is Convoy Nine. We see your three flashes. Hold position.

6
00:00:20,364 --> 00:00:21,095
They saw us!

7
00:00:21,395 --> 00:00:22,525
They saw our light.

8
00:00:24,864 --> 00:00:29,052
Stay where you signalled. Keep your supplies together. Leave a note if you move.

9
00:00:30,444 --> 00:00:31,428
Who are these people?

10
00:00:31,728 --> 00:00:33,872
Anyone who sees a light and comes anyway.

11
00:00:35,844 --> 00:00:41,112
Forty-one people. One village. And now, a road out.

12
00:00:41,712 --> 00:00:46,107
The Signal. Part four of four. Follow for the next story.
